        "bio": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EAssalamu Alaikum\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EIntroduction.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EMy name is Mohammad Ariful Islam&nbsp;Al-Azhari. MPhil Researcher at the Department of Prophetic Tradition (Hadith) and its Sciences from the Faculty of Usul-Eddin (Theology) in Al-Azhar University, Cairo, Egypt. I'm from Bangladesh.I live in Cairo, Egypt.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EAbout Teaching Al-Qur'an.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003E*&nbsp;I'm a professional Qur'an teacher.l have been working as a Qur'an and Tajweed teacher for many years.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EI can teach Al-Qur'an from Alphabet to Recitation, Reading and Memoriging with Tajweed. I'm ready to teach students of all ages.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EExperience:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EI have several years of experience teaching the Al-Qur'an to people of all ages in the Bangladesh &amp; Germany.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EI follow the following methods to teach Arabic Language.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003E&nbsp;First: سلسلة التحفة الأزهرية\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EThese are the prescribed textbooks for teaching Arabic to non-native speakers at Al-Azhar Institute for Expatriates.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003ESecond: سلسلة العربية بين يديك\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EThese are the famous books for teaching Arabic to non-Arabs.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EMy methodology in teaching Hadith and its sciences.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EI follow the methodology of Al-Azhar Al-Sharif in teaching Hadith and its sciences.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EI have obtained oral and written ljaazah (Sanad), both general and special, for books on Hadith and its sciences, the Prophet’s biography, the creed and others.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EThe most famous of them are: the nine famous books of Hadith, the Forty Series and others.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003EI obtained these ljaazah (Sanad) first from the senior scholars of Al-Azhar Al-Sharif and others in Egypt.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003ENote: Whoever learns any book from me from them, will obtain a special ljaazah (Sanad) from me.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\"color: black;\"\u003E&nbsp;\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
